{
  "section": "stamp-cards",
  "account": "stamp",
  "viewport": {
    "width": 1440,
    "height": 1000
  },
  "defaultWaitMs": 3000,
  "_notes": [
    "READ-ONLY. Confirm is never clicked, so no stamp is issued and no reward is minted.",
    "Member Q173600 (App Reviewer) sits at 3 of 5 on Brew & Bean's Coffee Lovers Card and has no email, so no redaction is needed on the dialog.",
    "The Issue button label is dynamic: 'Issue Stamp' at quantity 1, 'Issue 2 Stamps' at quantity 2. Selecting it by the static text fails.",
    "Member search needs the full qtap_id; a bare 'Q' prefix returns nothing.",
    "Number badges cover the text on these tight crops, so the boxes are plain and the Frame caption carries the order."
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "name": "stamp-mistake-quantity",
      "goto": "/stamp-operations",
      "actions": [
        {
          "wait": 3000
        },
        {
          "click": "button:has-text('Decline')"
        },
        {
          "wait": 6000
        },
        {
          "fill": [
            "input[placeholder='Search members...']",
            "Q173600"
          ]
        },
        {
          "wait": 3500
        },
        {
          "click": ".divide-y button"
        },
        {
          "wait": 4000
        },
        {
          "fill": [
            "#stamps-qty",
            "2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "wait": 1500
        }
      ],
      "clipTo": "div.rounded-xl:has(#stamps-qty)",
      "clipPadding": 30,
      "annotate": [
        {
          "type": "box",
          "target": "#stamps-qty"
        },
        {
          "type": "box",
          "target": "p:has-text('Issue multiple stamps at once')"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "stamp-mistake-confirm",
      "goto": "/stamp-operations",
      "actions": [
        {
          "wait": 7000
        },
        {
          "fill": [
            "input[placeholder='Search members...']",
            "Q173600"
          ]
        },
        {
          "wait": 3500
        },
        {
          "click": ".divide-y button"
        },
        {
          "wait": 4000
        },
        {
          "fill": [
            "#stamps-qty",
            "2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "wait": 1500
        },
        {
          "click": "button.w-full:has-text('Issue 2 Stamps')"
        },
        {
          "wait": 2500
        }
      ],
      "clipTo": "[role=dialog]",
      "clipPadding": 24,
      "annotate": [
        {
          "type": "box",
          "target": "[role=dialog] p:has-text('Current:')"
        },
        {
          "type": "box",
          "target": "[role=dialog] p:has-text('This will complete the card')"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "stamp-mistake-history",
      "goto": "/stamp-operations",
      "actions": [
        {
          "wait": 7000
        },
        {
          "click": "[role=tab]:has-text('Recent Activity')"
        },
        {
          "wait": 3500
        }
      ],
      "clipTo": "div.rounded-xl:has(table)",
      "clipPadding": 20,
      "annotate": [
        {
          "type": "redact",
          "target": "table tbody tr:nth-child(1) td:first-child",
          "color": "charcoal"
        },
        {
          "type": "redact",
          "target": "table tbody tr:nth-child(2) td:first-child",
          "color": "charcoal"
        },
        {
          "type": "redact",
          "target": "table tbody tr:nth-child(3) td:first-child",
          "color": "charcoal"
        },
        {
          "type": "redact",
          "target": "table tbody tr:nth-child(4) td:first-child",
          "color": "charcoal"
        },
        {
